{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a free demo version of European Deadzone: Polesie. The demo includes only the first chapter of the game, which is currently in development and not yet complete. This demo version differs from the full game as not all mechanics are fully implemented, and some systems such as the combat system will be improved and modified before the final release.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981570/extras/6626bb581d464f90bc36451311fca766.webp?t=1759362039\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polesie was once a peaceful region in Eastern Europe. Now it's a nightmare where succubi roam freely and most of the male population has transformed into ravenous ghouls. As one of  survivors, scavenge, craft, and fight to uncover the origins of the deadzone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981570/extras/53c1f443a8e7e378e6c4099ec75a56c6.poster.avif?t=1759362039\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981570/extras/53c1f443a8e7e378e6c4099ec75a56c6.webm?t=1759362039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981570/extras/53c1f443a8e7e378e6c4099ec75a56c6.mp4?t=1759362039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore abandoned settlements and facilities</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge for vital resources and equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft weapons, tools, and survival gear to stay alive</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade resources and rare items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research and unlock new technologies to gain an edge</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle succubi, ghouls, and other creatures</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your shelter to unlock new possibilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981570/extras/3118130cee534154629eacd932852282.webp?t=1759362039\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in the Polesie demands more than just resources and weapons. Sometimes, the most foolish thing you can do is trust someone. Sometimes, the most foolish thing is not to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with different factions</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop deep connections with characters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build trust through dangerous quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become more than just friends</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981570/extras/9ed1062326da290f3734ed76a621e88b.avif?t=1759362039\" width=308 height=396 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981570/extras/b9dfa49553f1bf5cc4e88c5ad003dbbf.avif?t=1759362039\" width=308 height=396 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plea